 toxicity in the elderly: a study of prescribing practices in two populations</article-title><source>J Gerontol</source><year>1983</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>35</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6129272</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b8-cia-4-225"><label>8.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wimo</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An estimate of the total worldwide societal costs of dementia in 2005</article-title><source>Alzheimer and Dementia</source><year>2007</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>81</fpage><lpage>921</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b9-cia-4-225"><label>9.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tune</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Anticholinergic effects of medications in elderly patients</article-title><source>J Clin Psychiatry</source><year>2001</year><volume>62</volume><issue>21</issue><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>14</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11584981</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-cia-4-225"><label>10.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tune</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Association of postoperative delirium with raised serum levels of anti-cholinergic drugs</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1981</year><volume>2</volume><issue>8248</issue><fpage>651</fpage><lpage>653</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6116042</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11-cia-4-225"><label>11.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Association of low serum anticholinergic levels and cognitive impairment in elderly presurgica